{
	"description": "With the publishing package, an outline_tree holds a tree of nodes {_id, values?, children?}, each _id unique across the tree, each node's values checked against the Blueprint Release its Field resolved to; unresolved, a node's values are an opaque record,",
	"packages": [
		"publishing"
	],
